Kavibay — license map
=====================

This repository uses per-directory licenses (SPDX). Full license texts live in
each directory's LICENSE file.

| Path | SPDX | Notes |
|------|------|-------|
| core/ | GPL-3.0-or-later | Application frontend under core/app/ |
| src-tauri/ | GPL-3.0-or-later | Rust backend; part of core (kept at repo root for Tauri CLI) |
| Root build/config (package.json, vite.config.ts, tsconfig*.json, index.html, …) | GPL-3.0-or-later | Core build tooling |
| scripts/ | GPL-3.0-or-later | |
| sdk/ | MIT | Extension-facing SDK implementations |
| extensions/ | MIT | First-party FE reference widgets |
| examples/ | MIT | Runtime package templates / probes |
| docs/ | CC-BY-4.0 | Guides, specs, plans (code snippets additionally MIT — see docs/LICENSE) |

Binary distributions of the Kavibay application are licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later
as a whole, even though they may embed MIT-licensed extension and SDK code.

The name "Kavibay" and related branding are not licensed under the code licenses
above; no trademark license is granted by this file.

`.superpowers/` (if present) contains internal agent work logs only. No license
grant applies to those files.

